WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.830
- Were you left though
with any battle wounds

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:03.663
from your football days?

00:00:03.663 --> 00:00:06.300
Cause I grew up in Texas
and like, it didn't matter.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.820
If you came out a boy you
were playing football.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.380
Like if you wanted to or not.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.380
like, I had a lot of guy
friends than had to play

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:13.960
and they get so injured.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:16.550
So like, I mean, do
you have a lot of them?

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:18.280
- Well, you know I'm a Texas boy too.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.350
That's where I'm originally from and yeah,

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:22.610
I mean I've had, you know, pec surgery,

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.520
wrist surgery, all these different things.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.355
I feel great now, but you know my fingers,

00:00:27.355 --> 00:00:29.540
see how my fingers are like crooked.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:30.540
They don't go together.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.890
- [Kelly] Oh, yep yep.

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.736
- See this pinky, see that?

00:00:33.736 --> 00:00:36.376
And how about, how about this one?

00:00:36.376 --> 00:00:39.517
Okay, and how about this one?

00:00:39.517 --> 00:00:40.350
- Oh my God!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.183
Oh my God, don't do it, don't do it.

00:00:41.183 --> 00:00:43.770
Don't do it, I can't believe you did it.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.280
Oh, you're like those
double jointed people.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.320
- No, that is what you
call tearing the ligaments

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.860
to your finger and that
is what you're left with.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.120
But I've had thumb
surgeries and all that stuff

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:56.355
and I won't do it again but yeah,

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.910
it's like a good party trick.

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:01.213
- Oh my God, please say you did
that like on your first date

00:01:01.213 --> 00:01:03.613
like when you're ready,
just like check this out.

00:01:03.613 --> 00:01:04.470
That awesome.

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:05.910
- That way you know she's a keeper

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.350
if she sticks around after that.

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:09.760
- Like he's weird, I'm down.

